# Debug HUD scoping

ACTIVE TEST PHASE OWNS THE DEBUG HUD.

For each Gate / Phase field test, show only:

1. controls required to perform the current test
2. state required to understand current test progress
3. evidence required to determine PASS / FAIL

Hide HUDs and controls that belong only to other Gates/Phases. Do not
delete their implementation. Do not mix historical diagnostics into
every field-test UI.

Use `DebugHUDMode` (`cloudD5`, `gate4b`, `stage3`, `stage5`). D5 Cloud
UI is DEBUG-only, not production UI.

See `docs/DEBUG_HUD.md`.
